      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Richmond Railroad Museum, operated by the National Railway Historical Society, sits in Manchester and showcases Virginia’s rail history with archival photos and a massive HO‑scale model.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
